'''Plumber's Sponge''' is an {{Uncommon}} block obtained from {{NPCSprite|Plumber Joe}} for {{c|50}}. When placed on {{Item|water}} or {{Item|lava}}, it removes all of it touching the block placed up to 30 blocks away.

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
A '''Plumber's Sponge''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Plumber Joe}} for {{Coins|50}}.

== Usage ==
A '''Plumber's Sponge''' can be placed on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}} placed on {{Item|water}} or {{Item|lava}} to remove all of the connected fluid type up to 30 blocks away. It disappears upon use. 

